{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id187471067"}, "name":{"label":"luey da gremlin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-07-31T00:57:04-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.0.8"}, "id":{"label":"4544923349"}, "title":{"label":"I love it but a few minor problems."}, "content":{"label":"I love this app. I downloaded it on a whim and I’m glad I did. I’ve been using it to fall asleep but here lately, I’ve had a couple issues. Mainly the fact that the music will just stop after a few minutes. According to my screen, it’s still playing but no sound is coming out. I think a little bit more of an explanation on how it works would be great as well. Other than that, I love Mubert and it helps me relax at the end of a long day. I can’t wait to see this app grow and evolve into something perfect.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"8"}}, 
