{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id137031544"}, "name":{"label":"Tinda Man"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-02-24T14:38:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2.4.3"}, "id":{"label":"3810934838"}, "title":{"label":"Passes the Turing Hearing Test (if one existed)"}, "content":{"label":"For what is being offered the experience is great. Dynamic noises and never any sloppy transitions through the music. I would be interested in the ability for Mubert to offer a more personalized experience for the user. This would require the model to more robust but I think would pay dividends along the line. For a more simple approach you could offer a Thumbs Up/Down to gain a users sentiment of the current track to offer more personalization. Future features like user uploaded .wav files of favorite music to add further personalization to the model would be neat. \n\nThis type of technology excites me so I just think of all the different types of applications that could be added in. This is among the first applications in a soon to come industry that has offered a great service. Keep it up!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1154429580&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"6"}}, 
